WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.760
I heard all about you, Onibaku-kun!

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:08.080
You beat up Kyoku High
second year class, didn't you?

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:13.940
That's awesome! The second and third year
students here wouldn't even touch them!

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:18.010
Yeah, but I ended up busting my leg.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:22.650
Come on! There isn't anyone who can beat the Onibaku!

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:28.980
You think so? Well, if you ever have problems
with guys at other schools, just come to us.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.020
Right, Ryuuji?

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:32.280
Huh?

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:35.970
Uh, yeah...

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:38.650
What's wrong with you, spacing out like that?

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:43.530
Are you looking for a part-time job, Ryuuji-san?

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:46.270
Uh, err, yeah...

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.640
What's going on?

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.500
Both of you are spacing out on me.
It's not like you, Eikichi-kun.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.310
More importantly, isn't it about time we get going?

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.770
Eh? Go where?

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:09.340
Isn't it obvious? A raid on Kyoku High!

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.530
What?!

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.970
Listen up, those guys underestimate you.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:18.280
You gotta show them and the others at
Tsuji High, the Onibaku fighting spirit!

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:25.830
Ah, that's ridiculous! We don't need to go.
Our strength is written all over their bodies.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.880
Don't you want to be popular with the ladies?

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:32.420
D-D-Did you just say something, Hashiri-kun?

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:40.250
I think Onibaku already know there are
three girls schools near Kyoku High.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:41.870
It's known as Kyoku High island.

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:47.010
Do you know what would happen if you
controlled Kyoku High with your strength?

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:48.810
W-What would happen?

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:53.450
It would lead to the dawn of an era
where girls would be scrambling

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:57.100
to be the first to be with the Shonan hero!

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:01.680
I can see them, all those girls!

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:07.620
Yes! There is surely a world of debauchery waiting for you there!

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:09.420
<i>Come on, Eikichi-kuuuun!</i>

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:12.380
You mean... as many as I can handle?!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.750
Any girl I want?!

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.220
Ma-Makoto...

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:22.620
Weeell, how about we go!

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.850
<i>Even I will be famous at Kyoku High now...</i>

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.970
Ryuuji-san, why don't you come with us?

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:35.180
Oh, sorry. There's something
I have to do tonight. Gotta go.

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:38.770
Sorry! I'll hang with you next time. Later!

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:40.950
Hey, Ryuuji-san! Wait!

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:44.820
What's wrong with Ryuuji-san?
He's been acting kind of weird.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:50.560
Well, it's okay. After all, this is the
most important time in his life.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.890
<i>Good luck, Ryuuji.</i>

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:05.680
Are you an idiot?! I told you not to
start shit with the Onibaku, didn't I?

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:14.180
Thanks to you getting your asses
kicked, all of Kyoku High is disgraced!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:18.780
Isn't that better than you third
years sitting on you asses?

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:22.770
What Asakura? Who do you think you're talking to?!

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:27.050
Hey, wait. Listen, just don't
start anything with those guys.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:32.310
I'll talk to them, got it?
Don't get into another fight with them.

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:34.370
<i>I can't accept that...</i>

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:49.170
SHONAN JUNAI GUMI!

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:49.170
3

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.270
Those guys won't do a thing!

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:55.680
Us second year students have to
do something. Right, Yoshiaki?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:04:01.650
I won't be happy until I have
those brats groveling at my feet.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:02.760
There's someone...

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:10.540
Someone I can count on that'd even scare them.
I'm gonna get Ookubo Mitsuaki-san.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.060
What?!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.010
Don't be stupid! Forget about it!

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.450
Ookubo-san is too dangerous!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:21.590
That's right! You should know the guy's a killer!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:24.210
You'd get involved with him knowing that?!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.270
He's done this before.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:29.840
He'll do anything you want for the right price.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.840
He'll totally mess them up!

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:33.310
All right, let's go.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.040
Hey, wait!

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:38.400
Those guys...

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:44.240
It's them, isn't it? The Kyoku High
guys who got beat up by Tsuji High.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:46.100
No way! By Tsuji?

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:49.550
Damn! Everybody is looking at us like we're losers.

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:50.760
B-Bad news!

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.540
What is it, Yariyama?

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.570
This is bad, I just heard...

00:04:56.700 --> 00:05:02.160
What?! Did you just say the second years went
to talk with Ookubo-san about the Onibaku?!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.750
What are those guys thinking?

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.310
Long time no see.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:09.790
O-Onizuka!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.470
Hey, this is too dangerous!

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:13.470
Shut up!

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.560
I can't wait any longer.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:25.030
Huh? Who are you guys?

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.360
<i>I can't back down until they're beaten up.</i>

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:33.850
Um, I'm Asakura from Kyoku High's second
year class. Don't you remember me?

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:34.980
Hey, give it up!

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:40.700
I came here once before after
getting injured in a fight.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:45.950
Oh, that Asakura. I'm busy. Later!

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:49.640
P-Please, wait a moment! I want
to discuss something with you.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:50.870
Discuss something?

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:55.990
I want to control that bratty freshman
class, so I came to you, Ookubo-san

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:57.000
Freshman?

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:01.340
Onizuka and Danma of the Onibaku.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:08.140
Oh, I see. That sounds interesting. Well, come in.

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:14.880
What? Marriage with Ryuuji-kun?!

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:16.540
Yep, that's right.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:22.820
Well, I want him to graduate high school first.
It'd be good to wait a couple of years.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:26.260
After two years, we can rent an
apartment even if it's a small one.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:28.210
And we'll both live together while working.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:33.670
I see, you've finally made up
your mind that he's the one.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.100
Congratulations, Ayumi!

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:37.300
Thank you!

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:41.380
What? Drop out of school and start working?

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:44.680
Yeah. I think I should save some money.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:51.350
I can't always be relying on you. A man
should be able to stand up on his own.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:54.080
But for you own sake, Ryuuji-kun, you should--

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.780
It will be all right! You don't need to worry.

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:00.730
I just want to make you happy.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:02.990
Well then...

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:06.770
I have a job interview now, so I'll be off.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.490
Wait, Ryuuji-kun!

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:11.620
Sorry about what happened, Onizuka.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:15.540
The second years were running wild.

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:19.290
Us third years didn't have any part in it.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:24.450
I'll be the one to restrain them. I'd like
to be the one to bully my own students.

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:28.470
So, don't give us too much trouble, Onizuka.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:35.930
I understand. I guess I can't if you're
going so far to stop the dispute yourself.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.240
Okay, let's call it even this time.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.010
Let's go, Makoto.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:41.570
Okay!

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:43.540
Be careful, Onizuka.

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.800
It doesn't look like Asakura
and his gang have given up yet.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:53.100
Don't worry about me. Even injured,
the Onibaku doesn't lose to anyone.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:54.080
Later!

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:55.260
Wait, Onizuka!

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:58.490
Ookubo-san is involved as well.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:07:59.540
What...?

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:02.360
Well, drink up.

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:05.430
I see. It's that Onizuka you're after.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:09.030
He's still talking big, huh?

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:12.580
So, that's why you came to me, eh?

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:18.870
T-That's right! I thought if I
could talk with you about it...

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.140
Hey! Hand it over.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:24.850
It's not much but... here's a
small token of our gratitude.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:28.350
Hey! Do you know who you're
asking to pick up your shit?

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.690
You'll get hurt if you don't give me some respect!

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:32.670
N-No, well... if there's any more...

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.670
Asakura, is this your woman?

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.930
Eh... yeah, she is...

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:43.690
Have her come.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:47.810
Instead of money, lend me your woman for a night.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:52.980
P-Please, anything but that!
I'm serious about this girl!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.150
Don't take me lightly, you bastard.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.450
No... stop it!

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:08.070
Hey, be quiet! Your boyfriend is giving you to me.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.920
That's not true!

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.340
You shut up!

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:25.310
No! Save me, Yoshiaki!!
Yoshiaki, where are you?!

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:26.710
<i>Natsumi...</i>

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:30.700
Are you all right? That's the girl
you've been dating for two years!

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.220
I told you Ookubo-san was...

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:39.020
Shut up... SHUT UP!! I can't go back now!
There's nowhere else I can go!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:41.950
Hey, who's Ookubo anyway?

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:46.370
Wait up! Why do you have such
a serious look on your face?

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:48.080
Shut up! Keep quiet about it!

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:49.310
Hey, wait!

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:58.560
What's wrong, Asakura? You crying?
Are you really that sad?

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:02.340
I'll be looking forward to
seeing her again, Asakura.

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:07.390
Anyway, don't worry. I'll get the Onibaku for you.

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:08.880
Then...!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:13.420
Bring me a million yen before I beat the up.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:17.480
A-A million?! You said Natsumi
would be enough. That's why I...

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:24.830
You don't gotta pay! I'll just mess you up so bad you won't be making money no more.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:26.620
Welcome!

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:29.230
Could I have two blends, please?

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.350
Coming right up!

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:31.540
Two blends!

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:36.300
Just look at me, Ayumi-chan,
I'm the reborn Ryuuji!

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:40.350
That's right, starting now, I've
become a man living for love.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:43.970
Sorry!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.220
Excuse me! I'm sorry!

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:54.980
He's actually working at a real job. I guess
there's no way I can talk to him about this.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:59.980
What are you looking so sad for?
Are you lonely without Ryuuji?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.100
H-How long have you guys been there?

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:07.700
I heard from them that Ryuuji was
working here. So, he's fallen in love, eh?

00:11:07.820 --> 00:11:10.430
And I heard that you raided
Kyoku High the other day!

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:13.700
Yeah! That really was awesome, wasn't it?

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:18.200
Taking on three of them without backing
down one step. Right, Eikichi-kun?

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.060
Uh, well... I guess so.

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:24.050
Hey, Eikichi, you're acting weird today. What's up?

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:29.600
He's been weird ever since he heard the
name "Ookubo" at Kyoku High yesterday.

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:31.360
Makoto, come with me!

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:33.780
That guy is acting weird.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.700
<i>Ookubo? I know I've heard that name.</i>

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:40.530
What's wrong, Eikichi-san?

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:44.150
You idiot! Don't talk about that in front of them!

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.710
Who is this Ookubo guy anyway?

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:47.570
Shut up!

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:51.940
Listen, don't plan to hit this
guy, especially with Ryuuji.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.000
Eikichi-san...

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.090
<i>Eh? You're turning down the marriage interview?!</i>

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:00.170
Mom, I'm sorry for bringing this up all of a sudden.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:05.110
<i>It's a little late to be saying that.
He's very busy, you know.</i>

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:07.290
<i>Just when everything was set up...</i>

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:13.050
Well, I've made up my mind on
someone else. Apologize to him for me.

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:17.490
<i>Anyway, let's have a talk together, all right? I'll come to Tokyo.</i>

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.360
<i>Are you there, Ayumi? Ayumi?!</i>

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:25.720
Sorry, mom. I just can't lie to myself any longer.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:32.280
I've decided to marry the man I truly love.

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.840
I wonder if Ryuuji-kun really
intends to drop out of school.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.710
Wait for me, Eikichi-san!

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:48.740
Yo, Onizuka! We need to talk. Just who is this Ookubo guy Makoto was talking about?

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:54.970
It's nice to know even Saejima and
Kamata care about me, but let it go.

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:58.230
I know I've heard the name "Ookubo" before!

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.820
Long time no see, Onizuka.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:02.750
Ookubo-san!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.140
Who the hell are you?
You trying to start something?

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:09.440
Y-You idiot! Saejima, stop!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.590
Saejima! What the hell do you think you're doing?

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:16.410
Outta the way, wimps.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:22.150
Well, why don't we have a long talk?

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:24.580
Let me tell you about something.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:32.120
It seems like you've really stepped over the
line with the Kyoku High upperclassmen, eh?

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:35.040
How should we settle this?

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:39.670
Ookubo-san, I don't want you getting involved.

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:44.250
You bastard! Since when do you tell me what to do?

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.660
Sorry, but this is between me and Kyoku High.

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:52.830
Besides, we came to an agreement about
that incident with the third year students.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:54.450
Hey!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.160
You're not getting off that easy!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:02.720
I don't know what the third year students
said, but either way, I don't like you!

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:06.760
Invincible Onizuka, my ass! It still ain't healed.

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:11.920
You can't tell me you've forgotten the
scar I gave you when I beat you up!

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:19.020
<i>You little brat! It's a hundred million years
too early for you yo be fighting guys like us.</i>

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:23.390
<i>I'm invincible! I'll never lose to guys like you!</i>

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:25.270
<i>Wait, let me have at him.</i>

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.130
<i>Ookubo-kun...</i>

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.430
<i>I'll teach him how things work around here.</i>

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:30.770
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:36.920
<i>You don't seem to understand that
gangsters these days are scary.</i>

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:40.480
<i>Oh, well... I guess I'll have to carve it into your body.</i>

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:48.600
I was trying to be cool, starting fight after fight after fight.

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:52.560
I had never lost before, and I often
started fights just to test my skill.

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:56.670
But that was the first time I felt it... fear.

00:14:57.970 --> 00:15:02.640
Well? Do you want to have a taste of
that again? The pain from back then?

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:10.720
P-Please, forgive me. I'll apologize to
Kyoku High, so please forget about this.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:14.770
I'll listen if you're willing to
bow your head that low.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:19.870
And in return bring one million yen.
If you do, I'll forget all about this for you.

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:22.140
One million?! There's no way!

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:29.700
You don't have to pay up if you don't wanna,
but you and Danma oughta prepare yourselves.

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:35.130
We really gonna let him leave?

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:38.930
We have no choice, not when he's involved.

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:42.860
Oh, Eikichi!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:44.460
What's up?

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:49.520
Well... you've skipped school for two or three
days, and I was wondering how you were.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.740
I'm doing great. How about you?

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:55.850
Yeah... me too.

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:59.530
Ryuuji, I have something to
talk to you about after work.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:04.560
Sorry, we made plans to go to
a movie together after work.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.520
Hey, I know! Come with us.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:10.780
Oh, it's that kinda thing. Sorry, I'll be going home.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.860
Wait, you wanted to talk to me, right?

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:15.420
Why don't we go out to eat
after the movie and talk?

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:19.130
That's all right. It's no big deal.

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:21.510
Hey, Eikichi!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:26.720
<i>He has such a happy look on his
stupid face. I can't get him involved.</i>

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.600
<i>I guess I'll have to put an end to this myself.</i>

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.510
That was funny, wasn't it? I feel refreshed.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:36.860
Yeah. That was the first time I've
watched a movie with you, Ayumi-chan.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:39.110
The first since we started dating.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.850
I'd like to watch many more with you.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.910
Ryuuji-kun, are you really all right like this?

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:47.270
Huh? What do you mean?

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:50.590
Well, Ryuuji-kun, if we get married
and you drop out of school...

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:54.680
you won't be able to do stupid stuff
with Eikichi-kun anymore, will you?

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.200
I wonder if you'll be happy like that.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:04.880
Of course I'll be happy!
After all, I'll be with you, Ayumi-chan.

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:09.380
Oh, yeah! How about I go buy something
to drink? Wait here for a second.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.560
Did you hear about the Onibaku?

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:22.030
Yeah, I've heard! They're going to apologize
to our second year students, right?

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.440
That's pretty pathetic.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:25.620
Totally...

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:31.050
Hey, would you fill me in on the details?

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.160
Hey!

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.240
What's wrong? That took a while.

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:37.930
Sorry, sorry! Here's your coffee.

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:48.930
<i>I heard Ookubo-san is the one settling things.</i>

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:53.110
Eikichi, what are you doing
keeping this a secret from me?

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:55.720
What's wrong? You're staring off into space.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.470
No, it's nothing.

00:17:58.630 --> 00:17:59.180
Really?

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:00.320
Yes, really.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:01.960
Anyway, about meeting my parents...

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:05.940
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:08.960
I can't take this!

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:11.070
Don't worry about it. Just take it.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.380
We all chipped in.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:13.510
You guys...!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:16.570
This is lame!

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.280
Seriously...

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:21.090
Ryuuji!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.350
Is it true you're going to apologize to Kyoku High?

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:28.810
W-What do you mean? I have no
idea what you're talking about.

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:32.270
Did you really think I wouldn't at
least know something about it?

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.110
C'mon, spit it out! What's this about?

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:38.940
Is it true that Ookubo-san's involved in this?

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:42.330
Shut up! This has nothing to do with you!

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:46.720
What do you mean it has nothing to do with me?!

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:50.670
Didn't we promise not to keep
anything secret from each other?

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.200
Shut up!!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:19:01.260
Quit yelling at me about it! This is
between Tsuji High and Kyoku High.

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:03.870
You've left me. This has nothing to do with you.

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:06.720
You're not a friend or anything anymore.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:09.680
Starting today, the Onibaku are finished!

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:12.880
Hey, Eikichi!

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:16.100
Hurry up and go back making
out with your girlfriend!

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:17.700
We're through!

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:22.600
I get it...

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:27.190
Hey, Eikichi, was that really call

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:29.650
What do you mean, he's left you?

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:35.170
Shut up. It's exactly like I said.
You don't need to worry about him.

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:37.490
Just let me handle this myself.

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:47.170
<i>Ryuuji... dammit, it hurts...</i>

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:53.800
<i>Ryuuji, tell me, why does it hurt so much? Ryuuji!</i>

00:19:57.510 --> 00:20:01.520
<i>The day's finally come when
Onizuka will bow to me.</i>

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:06.990
<i>The million yen I stole from my parents
will finalize it. That's right, I've won.</i>

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.590
You're late, Asakura! Did you bring it?

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:14.110
Y-Yes... just like you said.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.720
Hey, let's go!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:18.910
Yeah.

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:23.720
You showed up at a good time.
We're just about to go meet Onizuka.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:25.340
<i>Natsumi!</i>

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.530
<i>Natsumi with Ookubo-san... w-why?</i>

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.220
Asakura, what's wrong?

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:36.380
Wait!

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:38.560
What's with you losers?

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:41.720
We're the Onibaku-gumi!

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:43.310
Onibaku-gumi?

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:44.770
Are you guys idiots?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.550
C'mon, don't make us laugh.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:49.700
We've come to punish you in place of Eikichi!

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.790
Do you think you can beat me?

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.340
Now is the time to find out!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:58.380
Interesting. How about we do find out?

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.010
See you in hell!!

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:08.090
Brats! I'm really gonna give it to
you for starting something with me.

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:11.680
Saejima-kun!

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:16.970
Cutting off a finger and presenting it to your boss for forgiveness is a Yakuza tradition.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:15.630
What's wrong, Onibaku punk?
You gonna cut off you fingers or something?

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:16.960
Wait!

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:18.590
Eikichi-san!

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:20.360
So, you came, Onizuka.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:26.760
Me apologizing is enough, isn't it?
So, could you lay off these guys?

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:31.620
You're really being meek,
Onizuka-kun of the Onibaku.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:34.390
Hey! When are you gonna
get on your hands an knees?!

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:39.460
Eikichi-san, don't do it! We did
this so you wouldn't have to!

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:42.960
What's wrong? Don't you know how to beg?

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:46.150
We're all waiting for you.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:53.600
You were enough motivation for this guy to
give me a million yen and even his woman.

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:57.710
I didn't give you away!

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:04.190
I've had enough! Yoshiaki, you sold me for this?!

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:10.850
I was told I'd be killed if I didn't
listen to him. And for this...?!

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:13.010
Natsumi...!

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:16.920
I've had pictures taken of me, been threatened,

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:19.890
and he's had his way with me every single day.

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:22.520
Every day and there was nothing I could do!

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:27.340
Ookubo-san! What's the meaning of
this?! You said it'd just be that one time!

00:22:27.630 --> 00:22:32.440
Yeah, right! If I've had her once, what's
it matter if it's two or three times?

00:22:32.470 --> 00:22:36.100
Did you really believe me? You're
really a naive kid, you know that?

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:37.310
No...!

00:22:37.690 --> 00:22:40.960
You could've just given me the money.

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:46.010
I loved you, Yoshiaki! I trusted you!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:47.090
Natsumi!

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:54.280
Onizuka...!

00:22:54.570 --> 00:22:58.170
You idiot! Can't you even protect one woman?

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:00.960
You bastard! Are you still standing up to me?

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.860
You think I'd bow to you?
The thought makes me sick!

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:09.180
Listen up, Ookubo! I'm Shonan's best!

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:11.720
Fight me one-on-one!

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:16.740
One-on-one? Fine, it'll be just like old times.

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:18.330
Come and fight, you bastard!

00:23:18.860 --> 00:23:21.430
That's not a good idea with your
foot like that. Please, stop!

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:25.380
All right. Let's go.

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:26.270
Wait!

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:31.810
There's no need for a one-on-one
with an injured opponent, is there?

00:23:33.230 --> 00:23:36.210
That'd be lame for an old Kyoku High boss to do.

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:41.080
Otsubo, since when can you
talk to me like that, huh?

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:45.840
I'm just making sure everything
is on the up and up. Is it, Ookubo-san?

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:54.340
One week. How about settling
this in one week, Ookubo-san?

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:55.700
How about it, Onizuka?

00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:57.670
Yeah, that's fine.

00:23:58.210 --> 00:24:03.270
A one-on-one fight will end this madness
between our schools. I can work out the rest.

00:24:03.300 --> 00:24:05.150
Are you up for that, Ookubo-san?

00:24:06.100 --> 00:24:08.380
Sounds interesting. One week then.

00:24:08.970 --> 00:24:14.200
Don't get scared and run off. I need
you to pay me that one million yen.

00:24:14.830 --> 00:24:18.780
And if Onizuka runs away,
I'm gonna make you pay. Got it?

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:19.860
Let's go.

00:24:22.590 --> 00:24:23.280
Natsumi!

00:24:26.500 --> 00:24:31.260
Onizuka, do your best. Your foot
might not be healed in a week...

00:24:32.710 --> 00:24:35.850
But this is the most I could do to help you.

00:24:36.640 --> 00:24:38.850
Thanks, I owe you.

00:24:42.760 --> 00:24:44.150
This is a little embarrassing...

00:24:44.600 --> 00:24:47.450
Look, there's a difference in our ages, Ryuuji-kun.

00:24:47.480 --> 00:24:50.570
That seems to be the reason
why my parents are uneasy.

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:54.120
You need a suit to seal the deal
and show them your maturity.

00:24:54.970 --> 00:24:58.060
Does this really look good on
me? It makes me nervous.

00:25:00.030 --> 00:25:03.000
My parents are old fashioned, so should
I teach you how to speak to them?

00:25:04.110 --> 00:25:05.240
I'll be all right.

00:25:05.910 --> 00:25:07.700
We bought a lot today.

00:25:07.920 --> 00:25:09.160
I'm starving!

00:25:09.400 --> 00:25:10.660
Ittadakimasu!

00:25:12.370 --> 00:25:14.240
<i>We're through!</i>

00:25:14.760 --> 00:25:15.340
Ryuuji-kun.

00:25:17.550 --> 00:25:20.160
You were thinking about Eikichi, weren't you?

00:25:20.550 --> 00:25:23.100
N-Not at all, I was thinking about tomorrow.

00:25:23.440 --> 00:25:27.380
No, I can tell. Maybe we
should postpone tomorrow.

00:25:28.300 --> 00:25:31.730
It's all right. Thanks for thinking about me, though.

00:25:31.760 --> 00:25:34.900
I thought this might happen
between me and Eikichi.

00:25:35.520 --> 00:25:37.800
But, Ryuuji-kun, you have been down lately.

00:25:38.310 --> 00:25:44.110
This is the path I've chosen, so tomorrow
I'll meet your parents just like we planned.

00:25:45.700 --> 00:25:47.830
I want to live with you, Ayumi-chan.

00:25:48.780 --> 00:25:49.610
Ryuuji-kun...

00:25:50.620 --> 00:25:52.610
Sorry, it just came out!

00:25:53.240 --> 00:25:54.280
Holy crap!

00:25:54.910 --> 00:25:58.420
Onizuka and Ookubo-san are having
a one-on-one battle to settle things!

00:25:58.450 --> 00:25:59.420
Are you serious?

00:26:00.040 --> 00:26:01.040
I wonder who'll win.

00:26:01.180 --> 00:26:03.730
Even Onizuka isn't a match for a killer!

00:26:03.880 --> 00:26:08.310
And Onizuka has an injured foot
too. He doesn't stand a chance.

00:26:09.420 --> 00:26:10.170
Ryuuji-kun...

00:26:11.810 --> 00:26:12.400
Ryuuji-kun!

00:26:13.650 --> 00:26:14.560
Shall we get going?

00:26:15.620 --> 00:26:17.040
I wonder if Eikichi-kun will be all right.

00:26:17.430 --> 00:26:20.310
He'll be fine. The guy's like a zombie.

00:26:22.060 --> 00:26:23.810
I'm not going to fight anymore.

00:26:25.520 --> 00:26:29.010
It'll hurt Eikichi, but I've decided
to live on the straight and narrow.

00:26:29.040 --> 00:26:29.770
Ryuuji-kun...

00:26:41.930 --> 00:26:45.650
<i>Okay, tomorrow at 4pm at
the tea room in Yokohama.</i>

00:26:45.680 --> 00:26:50.740
<i>No matter what, don't be late.
My father is strict about being on time.</i>

00:26:52.190 --> 00:26:55.970
<i>I've gotta do my best. I can't act like I'm 16.</i>

00:26:57.340 --> 00:26:58.460
Tomorrow at last...

00:27:04.140 --> 00:27:07.790
I wish I could have done stupid
things with you a little longer.

00:27:18.990 --> 00:27:22.370
There, see? My foot's totally healed!

00:27:25.390 --> 00:27:27.200
Don't overdo it.

00:27:27.510 --> 00:27:29.510
It's fine. I told you not to worry about it.

00:27:30.210 --> 00:27:33.300
I won't lose just because I can't use one leg.

00:27:33.890 --> 00:27:38.460
But, I kinda feel like I'm the one
who made you break it, so I...

00:27:39.690 --> 00:27:40.980
It's not your fault.

00:27:41.560 --> 00:27:44.030
This is my fight... and mine alone.

00:27:44.940 --> 00:27:46.220
Makoto, let's go.

00:27:46.360 --> 00:27:46.690
Okay.

00:27:48.980 --> 00:27:52.590
I'm telling you, this leg will
easily be healed in a week.

00:27:52.780 --> 00:27:55.050
I'll help you. Don't push yourself too far.

00:27:58.380 --> 00:27:59.150
Makoto!

00:28:00.030 --> 00:28:03.810
Onizuka, we came to finish this.

00:28:03.880 --> 00:28:06.980
Ookubo! This isn't one-on-one!

00:28:07.010 --> 00:28:12.560
One-on-one? What's that? I don't
remember making such a childish promise.

00:28:13.640 --> 00:28:16.150
You're one dirty bastard!

00:28:16.440 --> 00:28:17.470
You punk...

00:28:22.420 --> 00:28:24.890
You'd better prepare yourself for what
happens to punks who mess with me.

00:28:26.600 --> 00:28:28.370
I'm not even gonna ask you for the money.

00:28:29.480 --> 00:28:32.190
Natsumi, will you marry me?

00:28:33.410 --> 00:28:35.740
I want to make it up to you
even if it takes my whole life.

00:28:37.330 --> 00:28:41.880
I don't want you to say that. We'll
never be happy if it's for that!

00:28:43.970 --> 00:28:45.800
I don't want you to make it up for me...

00:28:47.760 --> 00:28:48.380
Natsumi...

00:28:55.090 --> 00:28:55.670
Onizuka!

00:29:00.920 --> 00:29:05.010
Why is Onizuka being beaten by
Ookubo? Wasn't the fight in one week?

00:29:06.350 --> 00:29:07.780
This has nothing to do with me.

00:29:09.200 --> 00:29:12.820
<i>But I owe him! Why don't I tell Danma?</i>

00:29:17.480 --> 00:29:20.170
<i>Ryuuji just left for Yokohama.</i>

00:29:21.320 --> 00:29:22.530
Let me make it!

00:29:27.960 --> 00:29:30.080
D-Danma!! It's Onizuka!

00:29:34.390 --> 00:29:35.300
What happened to Eikichi?

00:29:35.520 --> 00:29:36.080
D-Damna!

00:29:37.670 --> 00:29:40.250
Right now, he's surrounded
by a gang of Ookubo's thugs!

00:29:40.280 --> 00:29:43.880
That damn Ookubo broke his
promise about the one-on-one fight!

00:29:43.910 --> 00:29:45.950
You're the only one who can save him!

00:29:46.720 --> 00:29:51.060
I can't go. I have an appointment
I can't call off, no matter what.

00:29:51.700 --> 00:29:55.420
Aren't you his best friend?!
What are you doing?!

00:29:56.120 --> 00:29:59.130
Sorry, but I don't have any interest in fighting.

00:30:00.170 --> 00:30:01.800
What good is the Onibaku?!

00:30:05.300 --> 00:30:07.520
Well, you feel like begging yet?

00:30:07.670 --> 00:30:10.410
<i>Dammit... it's useless. I can't win...</i>

00:30:10.480 --> 00:30:12.330
Then it's about time to finish you off.

00:30:18.400 --> 00:30:19.730
Run, Onizuka!

00:30:20.090 --> 00:30:22.260
Leave this to me and get outta here now!

00:30:22.400 --> 00:30:23.490
Why are you doing this?

00:30:24.930 --> 00:30:26.480
I owe you one.

00:30:27.010 --> 00:30:31.720
You bastard! You know you're not
gonna get off easy for this, right?!

00:30:38.150 --> 00:30:41.000
Hey, hey, hey... die, you brat!

00:30:42.710 --> 00:30:45.070
Weren't you guys fighting me?

00:30:47.530 --> 00:30:50.050
I finally feel I'm back to normal.

00:30:51.660 --> 00:30:54.260
I'm gonna beat up the lot
of you, so come and get it!

00:30:54.800 --> 00:30:56.770
I'll shut you up, kid!

00:31:00.960 --> 00:31:02.470
Stop right there.

00:31:03.130 --> 00:31:05.120
I'll stab out his eyes.

00:31:05.810 --> 00:31:10.190
If you don't stop, it's over for him.

00:31:10.220 --> 00:31:10.980
Makoto!

00:31:14.320 --> 00:31:16.840
Now, let's continue the fight.

00:31:16.870 --> 00:31:23.300
I'll carve right into your body what
happens to punks that mess with me.

00:31:29.620 --> 00:31:34.130
You're being real dirty by
the looks of it, Ookubo-san.

00:31:34.750 --> 00:31:35.310
Ryuuji!

00:31:38.340 --> 00:31:40.800
Danma of the Onibaku has
come to punish you for this!

00:31:41.460 --> 00:31:41.890
You...

00:31:43.730 --> 00:31:48.650
I ended up coming. Ayumi-chan is
important to me, but you're important too.

00:31:48.680 --> 00:31:51.030
Shut up! You're all gonna die!

00:31:52.520 --> 00:31:54.730
Those words are gonna cost you!

00:32:01.000 --> 00:32:06.300
Dammit... you guys have gone too
far. But I bet you'll understand this.

00:32:06.330 --> 00:32:07.670
I'll gut you!

00:32:07.880 --> 00:32:09.170
DIE!!

00:32:11.780 --> 00:32:13.550
Won't you let me join you?

00:32:14.170 --> 00:32:16.130
It's time for us to show our skills.

00:32:16.380 --> 00:32:18.330
You dare insult me, you brats?

00:32:20.430 --> 00:32:24.150
Ookubo-san, get ready for payback.

00:32:24.180 --> 00:32:27.780
Wait, I'll take him. Don't any of
you guys lay a hand on him.

00:32:28.020 --> 00:32:29.680
I'll beat you to a pulp.

00:32:30.560 --> 00:32:34.890
All right, c'mon. I'll show you how
strong I am in a one-on-one fight!

00:32:42.190 --> 00:32:44.210
That was just a piece of what
I have in store for you!

00:32:47.170 --> 00:32:49.490
I'll write the strength of the Onibaku all over you!

00:32:50.840 --> 00:32:53.800
He sure is late. I wonder what happened to him.

00:32:54.490 --> 00:32:58.020
Where is he?! You see, there's no way
it would work out with some youngster!

00:32:58.970 --> 00:33:02.200
That's not true! Please, wait a little longer.

00:33:09.190 --> 00:33:12.280
What's wrong, Ookubo? You haven't hit me once.

00:33:12.310 --> 00:33:14.320
Should I finish you off right here and now?

00:33:16.310 --> 00:33:18.250
I'll be the one finishing you off!

00:33:19.030 --> 00:33:19.890
Just try it!

00:33:21.940 --> 00:33:24.730
Bastard! You can't use that
in a fair one-on-one fight!

00:33:25.460 --> 00:33:26.700
Like I give a shit!

00:33:32.400 --> 00:33:36.720
Hey! Are you serious? Are you
trying to kill me with that th--

00:33:39.410 --> 00:33:40.190
Stand up.

00:33:41.550 --> 00:33:42.890
I said stand up!

00:33:43.930 --> 00:33:47.670
Give me a break. I'm sorry, I...

00:33:48.150 --> 00:33:50.010
Yeah, right!

00:33:50.380 --> 00:33:58.320
<i>It's overpowering. You're strong Eikichi.
I can't cut ties with you. Keep on fighting.</i>

00:33:58.660 --> 00:34:01.920
You're the one man I can never forgive!

00:34:02.390 --> 00:34:05.990
I should end what was started a
long time ago, once and for all!

00:34:10.880 --> 00:34:12.500
Put you head right here. C'mon!

00:34:13.400 --> 00:34:16.330
You're gonna kill him if you
hit him with that, Onizuka!

00:34:22.920 --> 00:34:26.510
Too bad, eh, Onizuka? I called these guys on you.

00:34:27.230 --> 00:34:29.880
Hey! Hurry up and beat these guys up!

00:34:31.440 --> 00:34:34.690
Beat these guys? What are you
talking about, Ookubo-san?

00:34:34.720 --> 00:34:39.620
This is a one-on-one fight after all right?
So it's not our place to get involved.

00:34:40.530 --> 00:34:43.010
And we didn't come for your sake.

00:34:43.100 --> 00:34:47.780
We've come for Onizuka who
ended up in one of your dirty traps.

00:34:47.780 --> 00:34:52.580
Sad to say, but there ain't nobody left
at Kyoku High that looks up to you.

00:34:54.000 --> 00:34:56.260
Then, let's really finish this.

00:34:56.360 --> 00:34:58.990
Wait! I'm sorry! I apologize!

00:35:05.010 --> 00:35:06.290
You did it, Eikichi.

00:35:07.340 --> 00:35:08.520
It was no problem.

00:35:09.050 --> 00:35:13.470
I can't split with you after all.
We'll look out for each other.

00:35:14.280 --> 00:35:18.270
Even if I get married, I'll help you
out when you're in tough situations.

00:35:25.600 --> 00:35:27.980
How long does that man intend to make me wait?!

00:35:28.770 --> 00:35:30.190
Dear, calm down!

00:35:30.450 --> 00:35:33.290
He's more than one and a half
hour late for our meeting, isn't he?

00:35:34.700 --> 00:35:35.080
That's it!

00:35:35.170 --> 00:35:38.450
Wait, dad... 30 more minutes!

00:35:40.030 --> 00:35:44.660
Just wait 30 more minutes for
me, please. I know he'll come!

00:35:52.900 --> 00:35:54.290
Please, let me make it!

00:35:59.200 --> 00:36:00.940
Damn, a cop!

00:36:01.360 --> 00:36:03.370
I can't stop now!

00:36:04.930 --> 00:36:05.560
<i>Ryuuji-kun...</i>

00:36:14.510 --> 00:36:18.230
You don't get married on a whim,
you know. End this, Ayumi.

00:36:24.370 --> 00:36:26.500
In the end you didn't come, Ryuuji-kun...

00:36:32.300 --> 00:36:33.060
Ayumi-chan!

00:36:34.230 --> 00:36:35.830
I'm sorry, I'm totally late.

00:36:37.140 --> 00:36:37.850
Ryuuji-kun!

00:36:40.010 --> 00:36:41.200
Where are your mother and father?

00:36:41.230 --> 00:36:43.610
I have to apologize to them
right away. Quick, tell m--

00:36:44.690 --> 00:36:45.320
Ayumi-chan...

00:36:45.470 --> 00:36:47.360
I'm glad. You did come.

00:36:49.020 --> 00:36:50.500
Why do you look like that?

00:36:52.920 --> 00:36:54.300
I kinda fell down some stairs...

00:36:55.650 --> 00:36:58.240
But more importantly, take me to
your mother and father right away!

00:36:58.360 --> 00:36:59.080
It's all right.

00:36:59.840 --> 00:37:01.930
But I have to at least meet them properly.

00:37:02.150 --> 00:37:05.550
Why were you late? Why do you have those bruises?

00:37:08.750 --> 00:37:10.550
I'm sorry. It was just this one time.

00:37:10.580 --> 00:37:14.950
Eikichi was in danger, and I couldn't leave
him to face that alone. We're friends after all.

00:37:14.980 --> 00:37:17.260
But this is the last time, so please forgive me!

00:37:19.510 --> 00:37:20.970
You're angry, aren't you?

00:37:21.490 --> 00:37:22.550
It's all right.

00:37:23.360 --> 00:37:28.930
I'm not angry. After all, that's what I
love about you, how you live so freely.

00:37:29.190 --> 00:37:30.490
Really? So, you forgive me?

00:37:30.620 --> 00:37:31.470
Of course I do!

00:37:32.040 --> 00:37:33.170
Yes!

00:37:34.380 --> 00:37:37.440
<i>It's because Ryuuji-kun is the most
charming the way he is right now.</i>

00:37:38.660 --> 00:37:39.330
Ryuuji-kun!

00:37:39.710 --> 00:37:40.040
Hmm?

00:37:40.660 --> 00:37:43.480
Hey, let's go for a walk in
the starlit Yokohama city.

00:37:50.930 --> 00:37:55.870
They say if couples go to Yamashita
Park at 3am, they'll break up.

00:37:55.930 --> 00:37:57.720
I've never heard of that.

00:37:59.000 --> 00:38:01.900
Oh, look over there. There's a ship. Let's go.

00:38:02.590 --> 00:38:09.350
Walking with you somewhere like this has
been a dream of mine ever since we first met.

00:38:10.490 --> 00:38:11.230
Me too.

00:38:12.950 --> 00:38:16.080
Ryuuji-kun, I'd like you to hear
one of my personal desires.

00:38:16.410 --> 00:38:16.690
Huh?

00:38:17.920 --> 00:38:21.130
Hey, where is it you want to go this late at night?

00:38:21.210 --> 00:38:23.100
Wait, it'll just be a little longer.

00:38:25.710 --> 00:38:32.040
Uh, well, I wonder if it'll be unfair
to Eikichi that I'm getting married.

00:38:34.210 --> 00:38:40.990
And after all, friends are friends. I don't
think I'll be fighting. I won't let him get in...

00:38:49.020 --> 00:38:50.550
A-Ayumi-chan...

00:38:51.320 --> 00:38:52.530
Well, do I look good in it?

00:38:52.640 --> 00:38:54.180
Yes, you're beautiful!

00:38:57.120 --> 00:39:01.410
Come on, let's go to a church and
have our own marriage ceremony.

00:39:02.320 --> 00:39:05.330
I want to give that to you today,
no matter what. Just the two of us.

00:39:05.800 --> 00:39:08.160
Yeah, just the two of us.

00:39:16.500 --> 00:39:19.900
This is really like a dream,
alone with you in a church.

00:39:21.600 --> 00:39:24.960
I'll never forget this, I'll
never ever forget this day.

00:39:24.990 --> 00:39:28.570
No matter how many years pass
by, I know I won't forget this.

00:39:30.490 --> 00:39:31.190
I won't either.

00:39:31.850 --> 00:39:33.230
I love you, Ryuuji-kun...

00:39:36.190 --> 00:39:39.690
I'll always love you, don't ever forget that.

00:39:44.810 --> 00:39:49.310
Whaaat?! You had a marriage
ceremony in the middle of the night?!

00:39:49.340 --> 00:39:54.400
- Let me go, I can't breathe!
- Do you have any idea what you've done?

00:39:54.430 --> 00:39:55.870
Good luck, you bastard!

00:39:55.900 --> 00:39:56.420
Ryuuji-kun!

00:39:57.170 --> 00:40:00.760
What is it? What's with that panicked face?

00:40:00.850 --> 00:40:06.100
Don't you know?! Ayumi-sensei... Ayumi-sensei quit!

00:40:06.190 --> 00:40:09.900
What are you talking about?
There's no freaking way!

00:40:09.970 --> 00:40:12.630
But Yuki said she heard it in the office!

00:40:12.900 --> 00:40:14.060
Stop spreading rumors!

00:40:14.210 --> 00:40:17.450
It's true! What Ito-san is saying is true.

00:40:17.960 --> 00:40:22.630
What, a teacher in on this too?
C'mon, me and her are...

00:40:23.500 --> 00:40:25.150
Ayumi left this with me.

00:40:31.970 --> 00:40:33.470
<i>I'm sorry, Ryuuji-kun...</i>

00:40:35.590 --> 00:40:39.250
<i>In the end, I can't get married to you.</i>

00:40:39.750 --> 00:40:42.330
<i>Yes, I know I should have realized it sooner.</i>

00:40:43.100 --> 00:40:48.310
<i>What you would lose out on being 15 and married to a 24 year old woman...</i>

00:40:49.140 --> 00:40:53.990
<i>I finally realized that when I saw you show
up in those messed up clothes last night.</i>

00:40:55.160 --> 00:41:02.140
<i>That was your true self, the figure of a 15 year
old boy right in the middle of adolescence.</i>

00:41:03.900 --> 00:41:10.590
<i>People grow a little every time they meet
someone, and you need to meet more people.</i>

00:41:11.690 --> 00:41:17.140
<i>I'll never forget the marriage
ceremony we had together. Never.</i>

00:41:17.920 --> 00:41:18.710
Why?

00:41:19.270 --> 00:41:23.560
<i>As your teacher, this is the
final thing I can teach you.</i>

00:41:25.460 --> 00:41:26.560
<i>I don't understand...!</i>

00:41:27.510 --> 00:41:29.670
<i>Goodbye, Ryuuji-kun.</i>

00:41:31.320 --> 00:41:34.820
WAAAIT!!

00:41:36.640 --> 00:41:40.620
Why?! What does that have to do with anything?!

00:41:42.980 --> 00:41:43.480
Ryuuji...

00:42:00.620 --> 00:42:04.350
3

00:42:01.360 --> 00:42:04.350
SHONAN JUNAI GUMI!
